# The catalogue lives on app.getreso.app. Until Sep 24 these paths were
# proxied here, so Google still has getreso.app/c/…, /a/…, /v/… on file and
# was getting 404s for them. A 301 moves those links (and any ranking they
# earned) to the real pages, and costs no bandwidth — unlike the old proxy.
# Query strings carry over. Not redirected: /robots.txt and /.well-known/
# (each host keeps its own; app links only claim app.getreso.app).

/c/*          https://app.getreso.app/c/:splat          301
/a/*          https://app.getreso.app/a/:splat          301
/v/*          https://app.getreso.app/v/:splat          301
/f/*          https://app.getreso.app/f/:splat          301
/p/*          https://app.getreso.app/p/:splat          301
/l/*          https://app.getreso.app/l/:splat          301
/series/*     https://app.getreso.app/series/:splat     301
/concerts     https://app.getreso.app/concerts/         301
/concerts/*   https://app.getreso.app/concerts/:splat   301
/artists      https://app.getreso.app/artists/          301
/artists/*    https://app.getreso.app/artists/:splat    301
/venues       https://app.getreso.app/venues/           301
/venues/*     https://app.getreso.app/venues/:splat     301
/festivals    https://app.getreso.app/festivals/        301
/festivals/*  https://app.getreso.app/festivals/:splat  301
/search       https://app.getreso.app/search/           301
/search/*     https://app.getreso.app/search/:splat     301
/sitemap.xml  https://app.getreso.app/sitemap.xml       301
/sitemap-*    https://app.getreso.app/sitemap-:splat    301
